      <div><p class="sk-eyebrow">Free B2B cold calling starter kit</p><h1 id="sk-title">Get your next B2B cold calling campaign <span>ready.</span></h1><p class="sk-lead">Download an editable campaign brief, script worksheet and call tracker. See a completed example, then adapt the files to your own offer and buyers.</p><div class="sk-actions"><a class="sk-button sk-button-solid" href="{{ downloadBase }}.zip" download data-kit-download>Download the Free Starter Kit <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="sk-text-link" href="#sk-inside">See what’s inside <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div><p class="sk-small">Excel workbook, PDF guide and CSV tracker. No email required.</p><p class="sk-byline">Prepared by <a href="{{ authors.harjSingh.url }}" rel="author">{{ authors.harjSingh.name }}</a> · <time datetime="2026-10-25">October 25, 2026</time></p></div>
